  "date": "2026-11-24",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "第三季度保险公司多买了1464亿元股票",
  "title_en": "Insurance companies bought 146.4 billion yuan more stocks in the third quarter",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "金融监管总局最近公布了第三季度保险资金的使用情况。到9月底，保险公司用来投资的钱一共有41.64万亿元，比年初多了8.2%，比6月底多了1.99%。",
      "en": "The National Financial Regulatory Administration recently released data on how insurance funds were used in the third quarter. By the end of September, the money insurance companies used for investment totalled 41.64 trillion yuan, 8.2% more than at the start of the year and 1.99% more than at the end of June."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在这些钱里，放在股票上的有4.25万亿元，三个月里增加了1464亿元。股票在全部投资里的比例是10.56%。同一时期，沪深300指数下跌了12.49%。",
      "en": "Of this money, 4.25 trillion yuan was in stocks, an increase of 146.4 billion yuan in three months. Stocks made up 10.56% of all investments. Over the same period, the CSI 300 index fell 12.49%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "债券仍然是保险公司最大的投资。到9月底，债券投资达到20.73万亿元，占全部投资的51.54%，比6月底高了1.02个百分点。基金投资大约是2.29万亿元，和上个季度差不多。",
      "en": "Bonds are still insurance companies' biggest investment. By the end of September, bond investments reached 20.73 trillion yuan, 51.54% of all investments and 1.02 percentage points higher than at the end of June. Fund investments were about 2.29 trillion yuan, roughly the same as the previous quarter."
    },
    {
      "zh": "背景：保险公司收到客户交的保费以后，会把这些钱拿去投资，比如买债券、股票和基金。在所有保险公司里，人身保险公司的资金最多，有37.66万亿元。",
      "en": "Background: after insurance companies receive the premiums their customers pay, they invest this money, for example in bonds, stocks and funds. Among all insurers, life and personal insurance companies hold the most funds: 37.66 trillion yuan."
    }
  ],
